---
// Hero — SVC. Ciemny gradient + siatka. Silnik animacji w stopce.
---
<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-linear-155 from-navy to-navy-deep text-cloud">
	{/*
		WIDEO W TLE (później): wrzuć public/hero.mp4 + public/hero.webm + public/hero-poster.jpg i odkomentuj.
		<video class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 z-0 hidden h-full w-full object-cover opacity-30 md:block"
			autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" poster="/hero-poster.jpg">
			<source src="/hero.webm" type="video/webm" /><source src="/hero.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
		</video>
	*/}
	<span class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 z-0 bg-grid opacity-35"></span>
	<span data-speed="0.06" class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-[90px] -right-[70px] z-0 size-[660px] bg-radial from-orange/40 to-transparent to-62%"></span>
	<span data-speed="-0.04" class="pointer-events-none absolute -bottom-40 -left-[120px] z-0 size-[620px] bg-radial from-[rgb(39_24_126/0.55)] to-transparent to-64%"></span>

	<div class="relative z-2 mx-auto max-w-[1200px] px-8 pt-24 pb-14">
		<div class="max-w-[660px]">
			<img src="/logo.svg" alt="Sobotka Visual Creations" class="h-9 w-auto md:h-11" />
			<h1 class="mt-8 text-[40px] leading-[1.03] tracking-[-0.03em] md:text-[56px]">
				Bądź <span class="text-orange">wyjątkowy</span>
			</h1>
			<p class="mt-6 max-w-[560px] text-[19px] leading-[1.55] text-sky">
				Motion design, montaż i color grading dla marek, które chcą pokazać światu swój potencjał.
			</p>
			<div class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap gap-3.5">
				<a href="/#kontakt" class="btn-saber rounded-full bg-orange px-7 py-[15px] font-bold text-cloud transition-transform hover:-translate-y-0.5">Bezpłatna wycena</a>
				<a href="/work" class="btn-saber rounded-full border-2 border-cloud/70 px-7 py-[15px] font-bold text-cloud transition-transform hover:-translate-y-0.5">Zobacz realizacje</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="relative z-2 mx-auto max-w-[1200px] px-8 pb-16">
		<p class="mb-6 text-center text-[13px] font-bold tracking-[0.14em] text-white/55 uppercase">Zaufali nam</p>
		<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-14 gap-y-6">
			<img src="/delta-hr.svg" alt="Delta HR" class="h-6 w-auto opacity-70 transition-opacity hover:opacity-100" />
			<img src="/langier.svg" alt="Przemysław Langier" class="h-8 w-auto opacity-70 transition-opacity hover:opacity-100" />
			<img src="/betters.svg" alt="Betters" class="h-7 w-auto opacity-70 transition-opacity hover:opacity-100" />
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
